{"unit_id":"tag:0EZ0:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001>。选取 K-内射（injective）复形（complex）<MATH_0002>，由 <MATH_0003> 上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）组成，表示（representing）<MATH_0004>。由引理 <REF_0001>，可见 <MATH_0005> 也为 K-内射（injective）的。因此计算 <MATH_0006> 时，可用 <MATH_0007>。于是由《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>，可见等式（equality）成立。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"equality","target_term":"等式"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射性质"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"导出对象的代表"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"局部化位点上的系数"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示","context":"导出对象的代表"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"equality","target_term":"等式","context":"基变换等式"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D6J:proof","translation":"映射（map）构造如下。选取 K-内射（injective）复形（complex）<MATH_0001>，表示（representing）<MATH_0002>。选取拟同构（quasi-isomorpism）<MATH_0003>，其中 <MATH_0004> 是 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），由阿贝尔群（abelian groups）组成。则 (1) 中的映射（map）由\n<MATH_0005>\n给出，(2) 由\n<MATH_0006>\n给出，而 (3) 中的映射（map）由\n<MATH_0007>\n给出。要证明这些映射（maps）为同构（isomorphisms），只需证明它们在上同调群（cohomology groups）和上同调层（cohomology sheaves）上诱导同构（isomorphisms）。由引理 <REF_0001> 和 <REF_0002>，只需证明映射（map）\n<MATH_0008>\n为同构（isomorphism）。注意\n<MATH_0009>\n另一个群（group）也类似。选取任意复形（complex）<MATH_0010>，由 <MATH_0011>-模（modules）组成，表示（representing）<MATH_0012>。由导出范畴（derived category）作为局部化（localization）的构造，有\n<MATH_0013>\n其中余极限（colimit）取遍拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）<MATH_0014>，它们在复形（complexes）之间，系数为 <MATH_0015>-模（modules）。类似地，有\n<MATH_0016>\n接下来，注意拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）<MATH_0017>，其中 <MATH_0018> 是上有界（bounded above）复形（complex），由平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0019>-模（modules）组成，在该系统（system）中共尾（cofinal）。（这由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0003> 和《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0004> 得出；见第 <REF_0005> 节的讨论。）因此可以构造映射（map）<MATH_0020> 的逆（inverse）：将元素（element）<MATH_0021> 用一对（pair）\n<MATH_0022>\n表示（representing），其中 <MATH_0023> 是上有界（bounded above）复形（complex），由平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0024>-模（modules）组成，并将其送到\n<MATH_0025>\n此处唯一需要注意的是，由引理 <REF_0006> 和 <REF_0007>，第一个箭头（arrow）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。省略该构造确实为逆（inverse）的详细验证。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorpism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term"